419 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 203 0 R
/E (Let c be the cost per node. The reversal occurs when 6c + 8log2\(200\) = 25c + log2\(200\). Therefore 19c = 7log2\(200\), and c = 2.816158 bits per node. For c below this value, Tree B is preferred; above it, Tree A is preferred. At c = 12, Tree A is preferred. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [22]
>>
