/E (The notebook implements class priors, conditional tables, log-probability scoring and posterior normalisation directly. In log space, products become sums: log P\(c|x\) is proportional to log P\(c\) + sum_j log P\(x_j|c\). This reduces numerical underflow for long feature vectors and makes zero-probability events explicit as negative infinity. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
